Hi Rolf,

I just updated all the packages from the
Australian server, and then I ran both the
weather and audit datasets and they worked
perfectly. I did have a little trouble before i
updated, but I had a different error.

I am assuming that you are not using a scoring
file, but your just scoring the dataset you loaded in the beginning ?

The error message to me, looks like there is a
difference between the dataset and the scoring dataset in some way.

I would suggested you do the update packages, and
then run each of the scoring options and see if
any of them give you any errors, mine did not.
However I was not using a different scoring
dataset file. If you were using a scoring dataset
file, then each variable in both the modeling
dataset and the scoring dataset have to be
identical, or you get an error message, because there is no alignment.

Regards
Tony

