randomForest has issues scoring a new dataset which does not have
categoric variables with exactly the same levels. Thus your new file
has only one level for the Educatoin variable whereas the training
data had many levels. randomForest should still score it. I have some
code in rattle to help this situation, but it might be missing your
scenario - will have another look.

Regards,
Graham

